  "Il prend ça pour une provocation. C'est pire ensuite.": "He takes it as a provocation. It is worse afterwards.",
  "Tenir sans rien dire": "Hold on without saying anything",
  "Vous encaissez. Ça vous use de l'intérieur.": "You take it. It wears you down from the inside.",
  "Démissionner": "Resign",
  "harcèlement": "harassment",
  "Vous partez sans indemnité, mais vous respirez.": "You leave without compensation, but you can breathe.",
  "Conclusions de l'enquête": "Findings of the inquiry",
