  "Formation proposée": "Training offered",
  "Votre employeur propose une formation de trois semaines, prise en charge : certification, nouvelles machines, nouveaux outils. Les journées seront longues, mais le salaire est maintenu.": "Your employer offers a three-week training course, fully funded: certification, new machines, new tools. The days will be long, but your salary is maintained.",
