  "⬇ Exporter la sauvegarde": "⬇ Export save file",
  "⬆ Importer": "⬆ Import",
  "<div class=\"panneau\"><h2>Bonus permanents</h2>": "<div class=\"panneau\"><h2>Permanent bonuses</h2>",
  "<p class=\"muted petit\">Chaque lignée terminée rapporte des points. Les bonus s'appliquent à toutes les parties suivantes.</p>": "<p class=\"muted petit\">Each completed lineage earns points. Bonuses apply to all subsequent games.</p>",
